<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":1,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-26T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T09:23:57.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":38,"name":"May"},"cards":[{"id":51326,"front":"<p>When making your decision, you should _______ the long-term consequences. <em>(figyelembe vesz \/ tekintettel van valamire)<\/em><\/p><p>The committee will _______ the historical context when reviewing the proposal. <em>(m\u00e9rlegel \/ sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00e1sba vesz)<\/em><\/p><p>It is important to _______ the cultural differences when communicating internationally. <em>(tiszteletben tart \/ szem el\u0151tt tart)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy will _______ the needs of all stakeholders. <em>(\u00e9rdekeit szem el\u0151tt tartja \/ figyelembe veszi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">figyelembe vesz \/ tekintettel van valamire \/ m\u00e9rlegel<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ mell\u0151z \/ semmibe vesz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the feelings of others = figyelembe veszi m\u00e1sok \u00e9rz\u00e9seit (pl. Always _______ the feelings of others before speaking.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the safety regulations = betartja a biztons\u00e1gi el\u0151\u00edr\u00e1sokat (pl. All employees must _______ the safety regulations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the advice = megfogadja a tan\u00e1csot (pl. You should _______ the advice of your doctor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the law = betartja a t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyt (pl. Citizens are expected to _______ the law.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>Have regard to<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>regard<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>have regard to<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: have due regard to \/ have proper regard to \/ have special regard to \/ have little regard to<\/span><\/p><p>similar: take into account \/ consider \/ bear in mind \/ pay attention to<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disregard \/ ignore \/ overlook<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"Have regard to","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:14:56+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T08:55:59+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T23:00:34+00:00"},{"id":51319,"front":"<p>The orchestra&#039;s new _______ brought a fresh energy to their classical performances. <em>(karmester \/ zenekarvezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>Copper is an excellent _______ of electricity, which is why it&#039;s used in wiring. <em>(vezet\u0151 (anyag) \/ \u00e1ramvezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>On the bus, the _______ collected tickets and helped passengers with their luggage. <em>(kalauz \/ ellen\u0151r)<\/em><\/p><p>The research team is looking for a material that acts as a super_______ at room temperature. <em>(szupravezet\u0151 \/ nagyon j\u00f3 vezet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">karmester \/ kalauz \/ vezet\u0151 (anyag)<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szigetel\u0151 \/ akad\u00e1lyoz\u00f3 \/ g\u00e1tl\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 orchestra _______ = zenekari karmester (pl. The orchestra conductor raised his baton.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 electrical _______ = elektromos vezet\u0151 (pl. Copper is a good electrical conductor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 bus _______ = buszkalauz (pl. The bus conductor announced the next stop.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 heat _______ = h\u0151vezet\u0151 (pl. Metals are generally good heat conductors.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>conductor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>conductor<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>conduct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: orchestra conductor \/ electrical conductor \/ bus conductor \/ train conductor<\/span><\/p><p>similar: director \/ maestro \/ guide \/ usher<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: insulator \/ nonconductor \/ obstructor<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"conductor","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-16","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:29:34+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:14:12+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-16","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:15:45+00:00"},{"id":51287,"front":"<p>Please _______ of your waste responsibly by using the recycling bins provided. <em>(megszabadul \/ eldob \/ kidob)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to _______ of its non-essential assets to reduce debt. <em>(elad \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kes\u00edt \/ megszabadul)<\/em><\/p><p>He was able to _______ of the problem quickly and efficiently. <em>(megold \/ elint\u00e9z \/ rendez)<\/em><\/p><p>The general will _______ his troops for battle at dawn. <em>(elrendez \/ fel\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ csatarendbe \u00e1ll\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megszabadul \/ elrendez \/ elad<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megtart \/ meg\u0151riz \/ beszerez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of something = megszabadul valamit\u0151l (pl. We need to dispose of these old documents.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of waste = hullad\u00e9kot elhelyez\/kidob (pl. How do you dispose of hazardous waste?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of assets = vagyont\u00e1rgyakat elad\/megszabadul t\u0151l\u00fck (pl. The firm plans to dispose of its foreign assets.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of a problem = megold egy probl\u00e9m\u00e1t (pl. He quickly disposed of the minor issue.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disposable<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disposal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: dispose of \/ waste dispose \/ assets dispose \/ properly dispose<\/span><\/p><p>similar: discard \/ get rid of \/ sell \/ arrange<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ acquire<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:20:35+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-25T11:14:22+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-25"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:17:18+00:00"},{"id":51294,"front":"<p>I have no idea _______ what happened to the keys. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmif\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>There was no evidence _______ to suggest he was involved. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p>She received no support _______ from her family during the difficult time. <em>(semmilyen \/ egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy had no impact _______ on the company&#039;s profits. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmilyen \/ semmi<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): valamennyi \/ b\u00e1rmilyen \/ sok<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 nothing _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi (pl. There was nothing _______ left.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no one _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n senki (pl. No one _______ believed him.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 none _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n egy sem (pl. None _______ of them showed up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no reason _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi ok (pl. There&#039;s no reason _______ to worry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: nothing whatsoever \/ no one whatsoever \/ none whatsoever \/ no reason whatsoever<\/span><\/p><p>similar: at all \/ in any way \/ of any kind \/ in the slightest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: any \/ some \/ a lot<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:21:28+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:03:51+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:16:43+00:00"},{"id":51298,"front":"<p>When she heard the news, she called her mother _______ to share it. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p>The manager expects the report to be submitted _______ after the meeting concludes. <em>(halad\u00e9ktalanul \/ azonnal)<\/em><\/p><p>Upon receiving the distress signal, the rescue team set off _______. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p>He knew _______ that he had made a mistake, even before anyone else reacted. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n \/ halad\u00e9ktalanul<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): k\u00e9s\u0151bb \/ lassan \/ id\u0151vel<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 do something _______ = azonnal megtenni valamit (pl. He decided to do it _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 go _______ = azonnal menni (pl. We need to go _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 know _______ = azonnal tudni (pl. She knew _______ that something was wrong.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 start _______ = azonnal elkezdeni (pl. Let&#039;s start _______ with the presentation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>straightaway<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>straightaway<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: do it straightaway \/ go straightaway \/ know straightaway \/ start straightaway<\/span><\/p><p>similar: immediately \/ at once \/ instantly \/ promptly<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: later \/ eventually \/ presently<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:20:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:01:55+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:18:56+00:00"},{"id":51294,"front":"<p>I have no idea _______ what happened to the keys. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmif\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>There was no evidence _______ to suggest he was involved. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p>She received no support _______ from her family during the difficult time. <em>(semmilyen \/ egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy had no impact _______ on the company&#039;s profits. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmilyen \/ semmi<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): valamennyi \/ b\u00e1rmilyen \/ sok<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 nothing _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi (pl. There was nothing _______ left.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no one _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n senki (pl. No one _______ believed him.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 none _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n egy sem (pl. None _______ of them showed up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no reason _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi ok (pl. There&#039;s no reason _______ to worry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: nothing whatsoever \/ no one whatsoever \/ none whatsoever \/ no reason whatsoever<\/span><\/p><p>similar: at all \/ in any way \/ of any kind \/ in the slightest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: any \/ some \/ a lot<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:16:43+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:04:11+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:21:28+00:00"},{"id":51323,"front":"<p>After years of touring, the popular rock band decided to _______ and pursue solo careers. <em>(feloszlatja mag\u00e1t \/ sz\u00e9toszlik)<\/em><\/p><p>The government announced its intention to _______ the special task force once its mission was complete. <em>(feloszlat \/ megsz\u00fcntet)<\/em><\/p><p>Due to lack of funding, the research group had no choice but to _______ its operations. <em>(felsz\u00e1mol \/ besz\u00fcntet)<\/em><\/p><p>The general ordered his troops to _______ and return to their respective garrisons. <em>(sz\u00e9tsz\u00e9led \/ feloszlik)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">feloszlat \/ sz\u00e9toszlat \/ felsz\u00e1mol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00f6sszegy\u0171jt \/ alak\u00edt \/ szervez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a band = feloszlatni egy zenekart (pl. They decided to _______ a band after their last album.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an army = feloszlatni egy hadsereget (pl. The treaty required them to _______ an army.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a committee = feloszlatni egy bizotts\u00e1got (pl. The chairman chose to _______ a committee.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a group = feloszlatni egy csoportot (pl. The leader had to _______ a group due to internal conflicts.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>disband<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disbandment<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>disband<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: disband a group \/ disband an organization \/ disband a committee \/ disband a military unit<\/span><\/p><p>similar: dissolve \/ break up \/ demobilize \/ scatter<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: assemble \/ form \/ create<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"disband","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-18","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:14:39+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T08:52:52+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-18","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-26T09:25:56+00:00"},{"id":51324,"front":"<p>After the divorce, the parents fought bitterly over the legal _______ of their children. <em>(gyermekfel\u00fcgyelet \/ fel\u00fcgyeleti jog)<\/em><\/p><p>The suspect was taken into police _______ for questioning regarding the robbery. <em>(\u0151rizet \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manuscript is kept under strict _______ in the museum&#039;s secure archives. <em>(\u0151rz\u00e9s \/ fel\u00fcgyelet)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge awarded sole _______ of the estate to the eldest son. <em>(gondnoks\u00e1g \/ vagyonkezel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u0151rizet \/ fel\u00fcgyelet \/ gondnoks\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabads\u00e1g \/ elenged\u00e9s \/ f\u00fcggetlens\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in _______ = \u0151rizetben (pl. He was taken in _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 legal _______ = jogi fel\u00fcgyelet (pl. The court granted legal _______ of the child to the mother.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 sole _______ = kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lagos fel\u00fcgyelet\/gondnoks\u00e1g (pl. She was awarded sole _______ of the children.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take into _______ = \u0151rizetbe vesz (pl. The police took the suspect into _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 award _______ = fel\u00fcgyeletet\/gondnoks\u00e1got \u00edt\u00e9l (pl. The judge will award _______ next week.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: child custody \/ police custody \/ legal custody \/ sole custody<\/span><\/p><p>similar: guardianship \/ detention \/ care \/ supervision<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: freedom \/ release \/ liberty<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"custody","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on